      <div class="panel-hero-badge"><i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i> About Us</div>
      <h1>We're Building the Future of <span>Student Collaboration</span></h1>
      <p>CollabNest is a platform where developers, designers, and creators come together to build impactful projects — and grow their careers in the process.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="container py-5">
      <div class="row align-items-center mb-5 g-4">
