          <div class="section-label">Our Mission</div>
          <div class="section-title">Empowering Every <span style="color:var(--accent-bright)">Developer</span> to Ship</div>
          <div class="purple-divider"></div>
          <p class="section-desc">We believe every great idea deserves a great team. CollabNest removes the friction of finding collaborators — so you can focus on what matters: building something incredible together.</p>
          <p class="section-desc mt-3">Whether you're a solo founder with a vision, or a developer looking for your next meaningful project, CollabNest connects you with the right people at the right time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <div class="row g-3">
            <div class="col-6"><div class="content-card text-center"><div class="icon-wrap mx-auto"><i class="fas fa-users"></i></div><h5>Community First</h5><p>A growing network of passionate developers and creators.</p></div></div>
            <div class="col-6"><div class="content-card text-center"><div class="icon-wrap mx-auto"><i class="fas fa-rocket"></i></div><h5>Ship Faster</h5><p>Find collaborators quickly and go from idea to launch.</p></div></div>
            <div class="col-6"><div class="content-card text-center"><div class="icon-wrap mx-auto"><i class="fas fa-graduation-cap"></i></div><h5>Learn & Grow</h5><p>Work with skilled people and level up your expertise.</p></div></div>
            <div class="col-6"><div class="content-card text-center"><div class="icon-wrap mx-auto"><i class="fas fa-globe"></i></div><h5>Open to All</h5><p>Students, freelancers, and professionals — all welcome.</p></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center mb-4">
        <div class="section-label">Our Values</div>
        <div class="section-title">What We Stand For</div>
        <div class="purple-divider mx-auto"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row g-3 mb-5">
        <div class="col-md-4"><div class="content-card"><div class="icon-wrap"><i class="fas fa-handshake"></i></div><h5>Collaboration Over Competition</h5><p>We celebrate shared success. Great products are built by teams, not individuals.</p></div></div>
        <div class="col-md-4"><div class="content-card"><div class="icon-wrap"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></div><h5>Trust & Transparency</h5><p>Honest communication and open profiles build lasting professional relationships.</p></div></div>
        <div class="col-md-4"><div class="content-card"><div class="icon-wrap"><i class="fas fa-lightbulb"></i></div><h5>Innovation Always</h5><p>We constantly improve our platform based on real feedback from real builders.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center mb-4">
        <div class="section-label">The Team</div>
        <div class="section-title">Meet the Builder</div>
        <div class="purple-divider mx-auto"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row justify-content-center mb-5">
        <div class="col-md-4 col-sm-8">
