            <div class="team-avatar">M</div>
            <h5 style="font-family:'Syne',sans-serif;color:var(--text-primary);font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;">Malik Muhammad Ahmad</h5>
            <p style="color:var(--accent-bright);font-size:0.85rem;margin:0.3rem 0 0.9rem;font-weight:500;">Founder & Full Stack Developer</p>
            <p style="color:var(--text-muted);font-size:0.86rem;line-height:1.65;">Passionate about building tools that help developers collaborate, grow, and ship remarkable products.</p>
