<!-- ── HOW IT WORKS ── -->
<div class="page-panel" id="panel-howitworks">
  <div class="panel-backdrop" onclick="closePanelFromBackdrop(event, 'howitworks')"></div>
  <div class="page-panel-inner">
    <div class="panel-topbar">
      <span class="brand"><i class="fas fa-code-branch me-2"></i>CollabNest</span>
      <button class="panel-close" onclick="closePanel('howitworks')"><i class="fas fa-times"></i></button>
    </div>
    <div class="panel-hero">
      <div class="panel-hero-badge"><i class="fas fa-map"></i> How It Works</div>
      <h1>From Idea to <span>Launched Product</span> in 4 Steps</h1>
      <p>CollabNest makes it effortless to find the right teammates and start building — without the usual chaos of coordination.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="container py-5">
      <div class="row g-4 mb-5">
        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <div class="section-label">For Project Owners</div>
          <div class="section-title">Post Your <span style="color:var(--accent-bright)">Project</span></div>
          <div class="purple-divider"></div>
          <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">1</div><div><h6>Create Your Profile</h6><p>Sign up and build your developer profile — add your skills, bio, and portfolio links so others know what you bring to the table.</p></div></div>
          <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">2</div><div><h6>Post Your Project Idea</h6><p>Describe your project, the skills you need, the tech stack, and what collaborators can expect. Be as detailed as possible.</p></div></div>
          <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">3</div><div><h6>Review Applicants</h6><p>Browse profiles of interested collaborators. Check their skills, past projects, and send a message to discuss fit.</p></div></div>
          <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">4</div><div><h6>Build & Ship Together</h6><p>Once your team is assembled, use your favourite tools and get building. CollabNest stays out of the way — we just made the intro.</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <div class="section-label">For Collaborators</div>
          <div class="section-title">Find Your Next <span style="color:var(--accent-bright)">Project</span></div>
          <div class="purple-divider"></div>
          <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">1</div><div><h6>Browse Open Projects</h6><p>Explore projects posted by other developers. Filter by skill, tech stack, or project type to find the perfect match.</p></div></div>
          <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">2</div><div><h6>Apply to Collaborate</h6><p>Send a collaboration request with a short note about what you bring. Make it personal — project owners love enthusiastic applicants.</p></div></div>
          <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">3</div><div><h6>Get Accepted & Onboard</h6><p>Once the project owner reviews and accepts you, you'll gain access to the project details and communication channels.</p></div></div>
          <div class="step-card"><div class="step-num">4</div><div><h6>Contribute & Level Up</h6><p>Work on real projects, add them to your portfolio, and build lasting professional relationships in the process.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center mb-4">
        <div class="section-label">Why CollabNest</div>
        <div class="section-title">Built Different</div>
        <div class="purple-divider mx-auto"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row g-3 mb-5">
